<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">ATHLETE PROFILE / 个人档案</view><view class="title">你的起点。</view><view class="muted">数据仅保存在此设备。无需登录，PB 可留空。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
<view class="grid2"><view class="field"><text class="label">年龄</text><input type="number" value="{{profile.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="input" placeholder="18–100 岁" aria-label="年龄"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">体重 / kg</text><input type="digit" value="{{profile.weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 75" aria-label="体重"/></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">训练经验</text><view class="segments"><button class="{{profile.experience==='beginner'?'active':''}}" data-field="experience" data-value="beginner" bindtap="choice">新手 / 重新开始</button><button class="{{profile.experience==='trained'?'active':''}}" data-field="experience" data-value="trained" bindtap="choice">有规律训练经验</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">主要目标</text><view class="segments"><button class="{{profile.goal==='strength'?'active':''}}" data-field="goal" data-value="strength" bindtap="choice">力量提升</button><button class="{{profile.goal==='muscle'?'active':''}}" data-field="goal" data-value="muscle" bindtap="choice">肌肉增长</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">每周可训练日</text><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="id" class="{{item.selected?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="day">{{item.name}}</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">可增加的最小总重量 / kg（两侧合计）</text><picker range="{{increments}}" value="{{incrementIndex}}" bindchange="increment"><view class="picker-value">{{profile.increment}} kg ↓</view></picker></view>
<view class="section"><view class="section-title">三大项 PB</view><view class="muted">填重量、完成次数和日期。1 次为实测单次 PB，2–10 次用于估算，不要求测试极限。</view>
<view wx:for="{{pbRows}}" wx:key="id" class="pb-block">
  <view class="row"><text class="exercise-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="eyebrow">{{item.en}}</text></view>
  <view class="grid2"><view class="field"><text class="label">总重量 / kg</text><input type="digit" placeholder="可留空" value="{{item.weight}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="pb" aria-label="{{item.name}}PB重量"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">完成次数</text><input type="number" value="{{item.reps}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="reps" bindinput="pb" aria-label="{{item.name}}PB次数"/></view></view>
  <picker mode="date" value="{{item.date}}" end="{{today}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="date" bindchange="pb"><view class="picker-value">记录日期 <text>{{item.date}} ↓</text></view></picker>
  <view wx:if="{{item.estimate}}" class="estimate-panel"><view class="muted">{{item.estimate.measured?'实测单次 PB':'估算单次 PB / e1RM'}}</view><view class="metric">{{item.estimate.range}} <text class="unit">kg</text></view><view class="muted">Epley {{item.estimate.epley}} · Brzycki {{item.estimate.brzycki}}</view><view class="muted">保守训练基准 {{item.trainingMax}} kg <text wx:if="{{item.estimate.relative}}">· {{item.estimate.relative}} 倍体重</text></view><view class="muted">需使用接近极限且动作合格的记录；范围为公式差异，不是置信区间。</view></view>
</view></view>
<button class="link space" bindtap="science">计算依据与适用范围</button>
<view class="notice">年龄和体重不会直接换算安全重量。65 岁及以上默认使用技术适应模板；如有伤病或其他健康限制，请先接受专业评估。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">{{saved?'资料已保存':'保存训练档案'}}</button>
<view class="section"><view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view><view class="muted">不采集姓名、手机号和位置，不上传训练数据。清理微信存储或换机会丢失本地记录，请定期导出备份。</view><view class="row space"><button class="small grow" bindtap="export">导出备份</button><button class="small grow" bindtap="backupPanel">恢复备份</button></view><view wx:if="{{showBackup}}" class="space"><textarea value="{{backup}}" bindinput="backupInput" maxlength="5000000" placeholder="粘贴 JSON 备份" aria-label="备份内容"/><view class="row space"><button class="small grow" bindtap="copy">复制到剪贴板</button><button class="small grow" bindtap="import">验证并恢复</button></view></view></view>
<view class="footer-note">三项训练 v0.1.0 · 本地版<br/>训练规则为一般健身模板，未经过个体临床验证。动作与图示用于辅助理解，不代替现场技术指导。</view></view>
